      "text": "FRONTEND\n\nReact 19 + TanStack Router\nTanStack Query\nVite / TypeScript\n\n? Upload audio (? 200 MB)\n? Poll job + chunk progress\n? Confirm rep if uncertain\n? Review transcript, tone, actions",
