      "text": "DATA + STORAGE\n\nPostgreSQL via Prisma\n\nJob + checkpoint + heartbeat\nWord[] ? Segment[] ? Result\n\nOriginal audio in UPLOAD_DIR\n(or Cloud Storage mount); temporary\nScribe/emotion chunks are removed",
