      "locked": false,
      "text": "ELEVENLABS SCRIBE\n\nOne synchronous request for the\nwhole call keeps speaker IDs shared\n\nReturns diarized words + timestamps\nObserved 56:08 test: 31 s response\n9,764 words; 20 min timeout",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
